flowchart LR
    A["burn-in rows of one experiment<br/>(first 100, assumed normal)"] --> B["fit forecaster<br/>per sensor"]
    B --> C["one-step forecasts<br/>for every row"]
    C --> D["standardised residual<br/>z = (x - x_hat) / sigma_e"]
    D --> E["score: max over sensors of abs z"]
    D --> F["CUSUM per sensor,<br/>max over sensors"]
    E --> G["threshold chosen on<br/>development experiments"]
    F --> G
    G --> H["test: point PR-AUC + interval,<br/>event recall, false alarms per hour"]
